# MANDATORY POINTER — Do not use this file as the full rulebook

Cursor agents MUST follow the rigid compliance stack:

1. `AGENTS.md` — entrypoint
2. `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` — always-on enforceable rules (source of truth)
3. `.compliance/PROTOCOL.md` — required phases + hard stops
4. `.compliance/ledger.json` — machine-readable gates
5. `docs/TESTING_GUIDE.md` — Moloch testing methodology
6. `.compliance/feature-checklist.md` — per-feature Moloch checklist

## Hard rules (summary)

- No declaring done without `ready_to_declare_done: true`
- No git commit/push until verification gates pass (hooks deny)
- Moloch 8-point checklist required for every feature
- Proof required: show command output; never say "should work"

## Check

```bash
node .compliance/check-ledger.mjs
```

Imported GrowLink prose remains under `docs/` (including `docs/START_HERE.md` and `docs/MANDATORY_WORKFLOW.md`) for reference. Enforcement is the compliance stack above — follow it rigidly.
